{"id": "EUVD-2026-102747", "enisaUuid": "3b604fd6-77bb-3180-967c-2346c694f013", "description": "Mattermost versions 11.10.x <= 11.10.0, 11.7.x <= 11.7.9, 11.9.x <= 11.9.1, 11.8.x <= 11.8.5 fail to reject OAuth application sessions in the account type switch endpoint, which allows an attacker with a valid OAuth bearer token for a target user to permanently take over that user's SSO-backed account by setting an attacker-controlled password and detaching the account from its identity provider via a crafted request to POST /api/v4/users/login/switch.. Mattermost Advisory ID: MMSA-2026-00758", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T07:11:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T14:06:23", "baseScore": 4.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://mattermost.com/security-updates"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hhjm-mg95-jr6g", "CVE-2026-19076"], "assigner": "Mattermost", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2e1493c7-c3de-3336-b5c4-66d9d73edba2", "product": {"name": "Mattermost", "vendor": {"name": "Mattermost"}}, "product_version": "11.8.0 \u226411.8.5"}, {"id": "6e40309b-f573-3459-82c3-ef0635d8088b", "product": {"name": "Mattermost", "vendor": {"name": "Mattermost"}}, "product_version": "11.7.0 \u226411.7.9"}, {"id": "d4892d3a-7619-392f-b340-7ed29dcf3a49", "product": {"name": "Mattermost", "vendor": {"name": "Mattermost"}}, "product_version": "11.9.0 \u226411.9.1"}, {"id": "d5d9a9b9-14e2-38a8-85b9-8ebcade99b94", "product": {"name": "Mattermost", "vendor": {"name": "Mattermost"}}, "product_version": "11.10.0 \u226411.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4adec7a6-3a43-380b-b41f-bd10a5611ccb", "vendor": {"name": "Mattermost"}}], "isExploited": false}